{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "97d6c0218d7a5e3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗：你是……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "97d6c1218d7a5ff2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "事已至此，\\n你到这里来做什么。\\c\\n都是因为你，\\n火箭队才……\\r\\n才解散了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "97d6c2218d7a61a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然感情用事不像是我的作风，\\c\\n但是多少还是得请你\\n体会一下我现在的感受！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_04",
      "hash": "97d6bb218d7a55c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………\\c\\n算了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_05",
      "hash": "97d6bc218d7a5773",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "说实话……\\c\\n我有预感\\n你应该会再来这里……\\c\\n所以我写了一封信，\\n准备留在这里。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_09",
      "hash": "97d6c8218d7a6bd7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我读给你听吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_06",
      "hash": "97d6bd218d7a5926",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]：\\c\\n首先，\\n我要祝贺你称霸宝可梦联盟。\\c\\n虽然你严惩了火箭队，\\n但我其实并没有恨你。\\c\\n我反倒会以此为契机\\n构建一个更强的火箭队，\\r\\n有朝一日向全国\\r\\n宣布火箭队复活的消息。\\c\\n虽然我决定离开关都地区，\\n但希望你\\r\\n能一直在这片热土上活跃下去。\\c\\n再见。\\n　　　　　　　　　　　阿波罗"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_07",
      "hash": "97d6be218d7a5ad9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗：写这种东西，\\n我到底是希望你\\r\\n对我有什么想法啊……\\r\\n呵呵……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub044_system_01",
      "hash": "9119a07e78e55947",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗撕掉了信。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub044_rocketchief_08",
      "hash": "97d6c7218d7a6a24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……请你保重。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_044_max",
      "hash": "cc9ba4ed5e08b8e2"
    }
  ]
}
